  "id": "convergent-validity",
  "term": "convergent validity",
  "definition": "Convergent validity is the extent to which a measure shows the expected relationship with other measures of similar or related constructs. In practice, it is supported when scores on a tool correspond with scores from other relevant assessments or related clinical ratings.",
